WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:00.900
Hey guys,&nbsp;

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.260
You know, this there's a lot of craziness&nbsp;
that's going on in the world right now.&nbsp;

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:10.140
In Ephesians 5, it says do not take&nbsp;
any part in an unfruitful work of evil.&nbsp;

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.320
Of darkness.
But instead, expose them.&nbsp;

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.800
So I want to ask all of you who say that you&nbsp;
are reborn Christians ... what are you doing?&nbsp;

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:26.700
Should we not overcome evil with good?
Too many of you are doing nothing.&nbsp;

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.380
But the Bible says that we&nbsp;
should shine our lights.&nbsp;

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.040
But too many of you are&nbsp;
hiding and not doing anything.&nbsp;

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:43.560
So I want to encourage you not to just be&nbsp;
hearers of the word, but to be doers of the Word.&nbsp;

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:49.620
Obey God's Word.
Stand for the truth in love and in the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.040
That's my message to you today.

